{"id":"73933abd41be8c66","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-reduction-principle.md","title":"c.e. 集合的归约原理","display":"thm-reduction-principle — c.e. 集合的归约原理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-reduction-principle","aliases":["20-thm-reduction-principle"],"display":"thm-reduction-principle — c.e. 集合的归约原理","chapter":"2","section":"2.1","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Corollary 2.1.12","source_pdf_pages":[62],"source_printed_pages":[26],"depends_on":["[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-stages]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-reduction-principle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-reduction-principle</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-reduction-principle — c.e. 集合的归约原理"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Corollary 2.1.12"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>26</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathcal E\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathcal E\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}reduction\\text{-}principle}\\vdash\n\\exists A_0,B_0\\in\\mathcal E\\\n[A_0\\subseteq A\\land B_0\\subseteq B\\land A_0\\cap B_0=\\varnothing\\land A_0\\cup B_0=A\\cup B].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}reduction\\text{-}principle}\\vdash\n\\exists A_0,B_0\\in\\mathcal E\\\n[A_0\\subseteq A\\land B_0\\subseteq B\\land A_0\\cap B_0=\\varnothing\\land A_0\\cup B_0=A\\cup B].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个元素第一次在某一边枚举时归给该边；同时出现时固定归给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。元素之后不再换边。这个过程 c.e.、不交且保留并集。</p>\n<p>来源：Corollary 2.1.12；印刷页 26；PDF 第 62 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}reduction\\text{-}principle}\\vdash\n\\exists A_0,B_0\\in\\mathcal E\\\n[A_0\\subseteq A\\land B_0\\subseteq B\\land A_0\\cap B_0=\\varnothing\\land A_0\\cup B_0=A\\cup B].","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1081,"backlinks":[{"id":"c29191ea1d4ce7b7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-reduction-principle]]；see [[20-thm-rec-re]]；see [[20-df-separator]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-90","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-reduction-principle]] — 章 2；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-90","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-reduction-principle]]"}],"outgoing":["60af447f5d59a8dc","4ef1aee16db6b308"]}